# Team blue cap (ticket 19): the east castle's mushrooms, the deep cobalt of a sky-blue pinkgill (Entoloma), silky, paler at the
# rim, glowing a little through itself like the level's mycena (a smaller subsurfaceRadius than their 0.3), so the side's colour
# reads at night while the cyan-green stays the brighter accent.
